e samples of our patch types so you can see and feel the quality before placing your order. Request samples through our free sample page.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What backing options are available?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"We offer multiple backing options: iron-on, sew-on, Velcro (hook and loop), adhesive, and plastic backing. Choose the option that best suits your application needs.\"}}]}"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"3:[\"$\",\"script\",null,{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$10\"}}]\n4:[\"$\",\"script\",null,{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\":\\\"https://schema.org\\\",\\\"@type\\\":\\\"WebSite\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Masters Custom Patches\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://masterscustompatches.com\\\",\\\"potentialAction\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"SearchAction\\\",\\\"target\\\":\\\"https://masterscustompatches.com/search?q={search_term_string}\\\",\\\"query-input\\\":\\\"required name=search_term_string\\\"}}\"}}]\n5:[\"$\",\"meta\",null,{\"name\":\"google-site-verification\",\"content\":\"9378hOM0kQuLnOS_fyAQdFJZbr34x9INyV3t905efMA\"}]\n6:[\"$\",\"script\",null,{\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"(function(w,d,s,l,i){w[l]=w[l]||[];w[l].push({'gtm.start':\\n            new Date().getTime(),event:'gtm.js'});var f=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0],\\n            j=d.createElement(s),dl=l!='dataLayer'?'\u0026l='+l:'';j.async=true;j.src=            'https://www.googletagmanager.com/gtm.js?id='+i+dl;f.parentNode.insertBefore(j,f);\\n            })(window,document,'script','dataLayer','GTM-KBVLSV9W');\"}}]\n7:[\"$\",\"script\",null,{\"type\":\"text/javascript\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"var Tawk_API=Tawk_API||{}, Tawk_LoadStart=new Date();\\n            (function(){\\n              var s1=document.createElement(\\\"script\\\"),s0=document.getElementsByTagName(\\\"script\\\")[0];\\n              s1.async=tru